{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"42b0994407533551","name":"card_event_reckless_assault","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Soviet/Breakthrough/events/card_event_reckless_assault","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"RECKLESS ASSAULT","text":"Your units get +2+2 and: \"When this unit deals damage, deal equal damage to your HQ.\"","flavorText":"What has often been associated with the Red Army during WWII are human wave attacks, and although it is true that they were used to some extent, and often with disastrous results, it was not standard tactics of the Red Army. It is clear that the Red Army’s victory over the German forces came at a heavy cost of human life, but this was not due to disregard for human life. Also, the numerical superiority of the Red Army became significant over time and at great cost, but it was not as overwhelming as often depicted in Hollywood or German myth.","faction":"Soviet","type":"order","rarity":"Common","cost":2,"operationCost":0,"attack":0,"defense":0},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_event_reckless_assault","title":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_event_reckless_assault_title","SourceString":"RECKLESS ASSAULT","LocalizedString":"RECKLESS ASSAULT"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::order","faction":"EFactionEnum::Soviet","kredits":2,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_event_reckless_assault_text","SourceString":"Your units get +2+2 and: \"When this unit deals damage, deal equal damage to your HQ.\"","LocalizedString":"Your units get +2+2 and: \"When this unit deals damage, deal equal damage to your HQ.\""},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_event_reckless_assault_history","SourceString":"What has often been associated with the Red Army during WWII are human wave attacks, and although it is true that they were used to some extent, and often with disastrous results, it was not standard tactics of the Red Army. It is clear that the Red Army’s victory over the German forces came at a